{"id":"u-d84d8603-708e-418e-be15-91ebad4d6843","src":"community","title":"Basic Linear Progression","author":"Trey C.","url":"https://www.boostcamp.app/users/KNkoE4-alsruhe-linear-progression","desc":"Help reset and build overall conditioning and functional strength. Ramp weight in each compound movement. Run it in giant set format. Exercise 1-3 as a giant set with 90 seconds of rest, Exercise 4-6 as a giant set with 90 seconds of rest, and Exercise 7,8, & 9 more as a burnout giant set. Modify as needed. Ad 5-10 pounds per week for upper body and 10-20 for lower body. I cut OHP from the program and added an extra bench day with some shoulder emphasis because I'm old and my shoulders are garbage. This is Brian Alsruhe's linear progression format with modifications to accommodate for my age and injuries. He has a 12-week program that I highly recommend.","level":["Intermediate"],"goals":["Muscle","Strength","Bodyweight Fitness"],"equipment":["Garage Gym"],"minutes":60,"joins":0,"rate":0,"rateCount":0,"updated":"2026-03-15T03:30:58.303Z","variations":[{"name":"default","days":["Day 1","Day 2","Day 3","Day 4"],"weeks":[[{"ex":[{"n":"Bent Over Row (Barbell)","sets":[{"r":8,"rpe":8,"x":4}]},{"n":"Bench Press (Barbell)","sets":[{"r":8,"rpe":8,"x":4}]},{"n":"Side Bend (Dumbbell)","sets":[{"r":12,"x":4}]},{"n":"Dumbbell Row","sets":[{"r":8,"rpe":8,"x":4}]},{"n":"Bench Press (Close Grip)","sets":[{"r":8,"x":4}]},{"n":"Side Plank","sets":[{"sec":30,"x":4}]},{"n":"Dip (Assisted)","sets":[{"r":8,"x":3}]},{"n":"Tricep Extension (Cable)","sets":[{"r":10,"x":3}]},{"n":"Push Up","sets":[{"amrap":1,"x":3}]}]},{"ex":[{"n":"Kettlebell Swing","sets":[{"r":10,"x":4}]},{"n":"Deadlift (Barbell)","sets":[{"r":8,"x":4}]},{"n":"Plank","sets":[{"sec":30,"x":4}]},{"n":"Snatch (Kettlebell)","sets":[{"r":8,"x":4}]},{"n":"Romanian Deadlift (Barbell)","sets":[{"r":8,"x":4}]},{"n":"Bicycle Crunch","sets":[{"r":10,"x":4}]},{"n":"Cable Low Row","sets":[{"lo":8,"hi":12,"x":4}]},{"n":"Reverse Hyperexten